			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[With just five gameweeks left until the end of the season the FPL General is here to help you try and eek out that last bit of improvement that could see you rise up the mini-leagues. He's got a review of gw34, a watchlist update, captaincy advice and answers to listener questions]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[With just five gameweeks left until the end of the season the FPL General is here to help you try and eek out that last bit of improvement that could see you rise up the mini-leagues. He's got a review of gw34, a watchlist update, captaincy advice and answers to these questions:</p><ul><li>What should we do with Reece James?</li><li>Who are the best Man City assets to have for the rest of the season?</li><li>Raheem Sterling - Should we keep the faith?</li><li>Would you move Havertz/Mount to Foden for GW35?</li><li>No shot on target for Spurs in the last two games. Should we hold Son/Kane or move to a KDB?</li><li>Best differentials to catch up in mini-leagues as well as getting to desired rank at the end of the season?</li><li>Who are the best budget striker options for the upcoming DGW36 if you are on a Bench Boost?</li><li>If I have to drop one of Trent or Robertson to make my bench boost work, which one should it be?</li><li>What’s your preferred gameweek to Free Hit - 36 or 37?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
