			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[FPL General is on hand with some last minute help ahead of Saturday's gameweek 33 deadline. He's got up-to-date team news, captaincy picks, transfer advice, plus answers to these questions:</p><ul><li>Is Cornet, who is guaranteed a start, a better midfield option than the Leicester players, Maddison, Barnes, etc. who will be subject to rotation?</li><li>Should I sell Barnes for Maddison who’s in much better form, or are both rotation risks in equal measure due to conference league involvement?</li><li>Best Leicester defender? </li><li>Should we sell one of our premium assets (Salah/Son/Kane) for Bruno/Ronaldo?</li><li>Your opinion on Sancho if Bruno is unaffordable?</li><li>Is the Bruno two week punt for Salah worth it? </li><li>Which is the best defence to double up on? Liverpool, Chelsea, or City?</li><li>Do we keep Coutinho now with the possible DGW for AVL in GW35?</li><li>Out of these 3 forwards: Broja, Adams &amp; Weghorst, which one would you replace first? </li><li>Free Hit question - should you go all DGWers or mix it with SGWers who have good fixtures?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[FPL General is on hand with some last minute help ahead of Saturday's gameweek 33 deadline. He's got up-to-date team news, captaincy picks, transfer advice, plus answers to these questions:</p><ul><li>Is Cornet, who is guaranteed a start, a better midfield option than the Leicester players, Maddison, Barnes, etc. who will be subject to rotation?</li><li>Should I sell Barnes for Maddison who’s in much better form, or are both rotation risks in equal measure due to conference league involvement?</li><li>Best Leicester defender? </li><li>Should we sell one of our premium assets (Salah/Son/Kane) for Bruno/Ronaldo?</li><li>Your opinion on Sancho if Bruno is unaffordable?</li><li>Is the Bruno two week punt for Salah worth it? </li><li>Which is the best defence to double up on? Liverpool, Chelsea, or City?</li><li>Do we keep Coutinho now with the possible DGW for AVL in GW35?</li><li>Out of these 3 forwards: Broja, Adams &amp; Weghorst, which one would you replace first? </li><li>Free Hit question - should you go all DGWers or mix it with SGWers who have good fixtures?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
