		<item>
			<title>Double gameweek 33 preview - finding the best replacements for Matt Doherty</title>
			<itunes:title>Double gameweek 33 preview - finding the best replacements for Matt Doherty</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 12 Apr 2022 11:11:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>31:26</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/bd0f78fa-ac4d-11ec-9930-5f876b1a150a/media.mp3" length="45325304" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">bd0f78fa-ac4d-11ec-9930-5f876b1a150a</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=104</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750df6e5b65d787578be9</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[FPL General looks ahead to gameweek 33 and it's another big one with plenty of teams playing twice, and a few not playing at all.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>FPL General looks ahead to gameweek 33 and it's another big one with plenty of teams playing twice, and a few not playing at all.</p><p>There's also a quick review of gw32, a watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Best Doherty replacements?</li><li>With Doherty out for the season, is it worthwhile just going sideways to either Emerson or Reguilon?</li><li>If you don't own Son but you own Kane, Kulusevski and Doherty, does the Irishman’s injury present a must have opportunity to buy Son? Or is Kane &amp; Kulusevski enough?</li><li>Is KDB now on the verge of becoming an essential, given his form and fixture run until the end of the season?</li><li>Is it time to remove Arsenal assets?</li><li>Which goalkeeper aside from the big three can we trust for the rest of the season?</li><li>Is it worth it to ship a DGW player (Broja/Weghorst) to Saint-Maximin/Wood for a -4?</li><li>Best picks on a Free Hit this week?</li><li>Which combination of DGWs is the best with two free hits left? </li><li>Who are the stand out picks for triple captain between now and the end of the season?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>FPL General looks ahead to gameweek 33 and it's another big one with plenty of teams playing twice, and a few not playing at all.</p><p>There's also a quick review of gw32, a watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Best Doherty replacements?</li><li>With Doherty out for the season, is it worthwhile just going sideways to either Emerson or Reguilon?</li><li>If you don't own Son but you own Kane, Kulusevski and Doherty, does the Irishman’s injury present a must have opportunity to buy Son? Or is Kane &amp; Kulusevski enough?</li><li>Is KDB now on the verge of becoming an essential, given his form and fixture run until the end of the season?</li><li>Is it time to remove Arsenal assets?</li><li>Which goalkeeper aside from the big three can we trust for the rest of the season?</li><li>Is it worth it to ship a DGW player (Broja/Weghorst) to Saint-Maximin/Wood for a -4?</li><li>Best picks on a Free Hit this week?</li><li>Which combination of DGWs is the best with two free hits left? </li><li>Who are the stand out picks for triple captain between now and the end of the season?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
