			<itunes:subtitle>FPL General looks ahead to another double gameweek, with Chelsea being among the most appealing sides to target this week.</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[FPL General looks ahead to another double gameweek, with Chelsea being among the most appealing sides to target this week. The General has an updated watchlist, plenty of transfer and captaincy thoughts, plus answers to the these listener questions:</p><ul><li>Best Chelsea assets to target for DGW 28? In particular, Rudiger v James.</li><li> Would you sell Cancelo this week for a Chelsea defender?</li><li> Can we go without TAA now with Robertson performing so well?</li><li> Raphinha vs JWP - best choice for this week's double only? </li><li> Which is the best Newcastle midfielder for DGW28 and DGW29 - Fraser or Willock and why?</li><li> Is Bowen to Raphinha a move worth doing despite Bowen now having a game in the blank week 30?</li><li> Three tempting Southampton full backs, but each one a concern for minutes, is Bednarek the play?</li><li> Best picks for people on a wildcard this week?</li><li> Have two FHs still, the plan was always to use them in 30 and 33 but is there more upside to using one in 28?</li><li> Which out of DGW28 or DGW29 would the bench boost chip be best activated?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[FPL General looks ahead to another double gameweek, with Chelsea being among the most appealing sides to target this week. The General has an updated watchlist, plenty of transfer and captaincy thoughts, plus answers to the these listener questions:</p><ul><li>Best Chelsea assets to target for DGW 28? In particular, Rudiger v James.</li><li> Would you sell Cancelo this week for a Chelsea defender?</li><li> Can we go without TAA now with Robertson performing so well?</li><li> Raphinha vs JWP - best choice for this week's double only? </li><li> Which is the best Newcastle midfielder for DGW28 and DGW29 - Fraser or Willock and why?</li><li> Is Bowen to Raphinha a move worth doing despite Bowen now having a game in the blank week 30?</li><li> Three tempting Southampton full backs, but each one a concern for minutes, is Bednarek the play?</li><li> Best picks for people on a wildcard this week?</li><li> Have two FHs still, the plan was always to use them in 30 and 33 but is there more upside to using one in 28?</li><li> Which out of DGW28 or DGW29 would the bench boost chip be best activated?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
