		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[Salah Regret & Free Hit Gameweek 27]]></title>
			<itunes:title><![CDATA[Salah Regret & Free Hit Gameweek 27]]></itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Thu, 24 Feb 2022 13:45:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>29:54</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/db34f040-6af7-11ec-8fc5-9f03ee49dcae/media.mp3" length="43098493" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">db34f040-6af7-11ec-8fc5-9f03ee49dcae</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=98</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750e06e5b65d787578c10</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The General reflects on an incredible night for Mo Salah owners who heeded his advice to triple-captain him last week... and it's not the end of the world if you didn't.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General reflects on a late decision to wildcard, following last Friday's fixture changes, and why he'll get over not triple-captaining 84 pt hero Mo Salah... Plus, why it makes sense to use a Free Hit chip for Gameweek 27 as well as, answers to the following:</p><ul><li>Who are the best Triple Captain options, if you still haven't used it?</li><li>What's the minimum number of players you would say to play in BGW27?</li><li>I have six players from Liverpool &amp; Arsenal, and 1 Free Hit... Would you FH this week and save your wildcard for next?</li><li>Should those of us on a Free Hit aim to have some bench cover or simply put as much money into our starting 11 as possible?</li><li>Are Burnley assets worth a hit this week if we don't plan on keeping them going forward?</li><li>Who are some of the best differential picks for a free hit squad?</li><li>Foden vs Sancho vs Sterling for the free hit selection?</li><li>Which Man City triple up to go for on Free Hit?</li><li>Do you go for Fernandes or Sancho from the Manchester United midfield on a free hit?</li><li>Could Podence be a sneaky differential in the upcoming weeks?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The FPL General reflects on a late decision to wildcard, following last Friday's fixture changes, and why he'll get over not triple-captaining 84 pt hero Mo Salah... Plus, why it makes sense to use a Free Hit chip for Gameweek 27 as well as, answers to the following:</p><ul><li>Who are the best Triple Captain options, if you still haven't used it?</li><li>What's the minimum number of players you would say to play in BGW27?</li><li>I have six players from Liverpool &amp; Arsenal, and 1 Free Hit... Would you FH this week and save your wildcard for next?</li><li>Should those of us on a Free Hit aim to have some bench cover or simply put as much money into our starting 11 as possible?</li><li>Are Burnley assets worth a hit this week if we don't plan on keeping them going forward?</li><li>Who are some of the best differential picks for a free hit squad?</li><li>Foden vs Sancho vs Sterling for the free hit selection?</li><li>Which Man City triple up to go for on Free Hit?</li><li>Do you go for Fernandes or Sancho from the Manchester United midfield on a free hit?</li><li>Could Podence be a sneaky differential in the upcoming weeks?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
