			<description><![CDATA[<p>FPL General's series of interviews with the top FPL managers continues with Abdul Rehman aka FPL Salah, who boasts 4 top 1k ranks and 5 top 5k ranks - he is right up there with the very best in the world.</p><p>FPL Salah shares his selection and transfer strategies and gives some insight into the resources he uses to shape his decisions.</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
