		<item>
			<title>Is it too risky to wildcard for GW21?</title>
			<itunes:title>Is it too risky to wildcard for GW21?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Fri, 31 Dec 2021 13:08:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>27:03</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/eec177b0-3815-11ec-abc7-67e0083ed77c/media.mp3" length="39002297" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">eec177b0-3815-11ec-abc7-67e0083ed77c</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=88</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750e76e5b65d7875792cc</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with his last podcast of 2021 ahead of the New Year's Day fixtures. The New Year also brings with it the ability to play your second wildcard and the General has his thoughts on whether you should play it straight away]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with his last podcast of 2021 ahead of the New Year's Day fixtures. The New Year also brings with it the ability to play your second wildcard and the General has his thoughts on whether you should play it straight away, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is it worth planning or still live gameweek by gameweek?</li><li> With the Ben Crellin's predictions looking a little underwhelming for DGW22, should our plan be to use transfers to prepare? Or attack it with wildcards and free hits?</li><li> Is it risky to wildcard in GW21 for a Bench Boost in Gameweek 22 with all the postponements at the moment?</li><li>If you are on a wildcard for gw21, what are some key players that are must haves?<strong> </strong></li><li> What do we do with Bernardo Silva?</li><li> Replacements for Reece James?</li><li> Goalkeeper strategy? It’s time to move on from Ramsdale, right? De Gea or Lloris? Should we have 2 playing goalies?</li><li> Is it worth a hit to upgrade to Son from Gallagher if we are planning on downgrading James?</li><li> Is now a good time to ship off Smith-Rowe?</li><li> Is the Ronaldo and Kane double up on, if you want to differentiate from going away from Son with the latter due to his high ownership?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with his last podcast of 2021 ahead of the New Year's Day fixtures. The New Year also brings with it the ability to play your second wildcard and the General has his thoughts on whether you should play it straight away, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is it worth planning or still live gameweek by gameweek?</li><li> With the Ben Crellin's predictions looking a little underwhelming for DGW22, should our plan be to use transfers to prepare? Or attack it with wildcards and free hits?</li><li> Is it risky to wildcard in GW21 for a Bench Boost in Gameweek 22 with all the postponements at the moment?</li><li>If you are on a wildcard for gw21, what are some key players that are must haves?<strong> </strong></li><li> What do we do with Bernardo Silva?</li><li> Replacements for Reece James?</li><li> Goalkeeper strategy? It’s time to move on from Ramsdale, right? De Gea or Lloris? Should we have 2 playing goalies?</li><li> Is it worth a hit to upgrade to Son from Gallagher if we are planning on downgrading James?</li><li> Is now a good time to ship off Smith-Rowe?</li><li> Is the Ronaldo and Kane double up on, if you want to differentiate from going away from Son with the latter due to his high ownership?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Festive Fixtures Preview</title>
			<itunes:title>Festive Fixtures Preview</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 21 Dec 2021 12:43:51 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>25:51</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/ef23717c-3815-11ec-abc7-83cff040ba0c/media.mp3" length="37274210" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">ef23717c-3815-11ec-abc7-83cff040ba0c</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://shows.acast.com/the-athletic-fpl-podcast/episodes/683750e99bd0275f2c4a4435</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750e99bd0275f2c4a4435</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The Premier League is set to continue throughout the Christmas period despite the ongoing COVID concerns, so the FPL General is here to get you ready for what will hopefully be a busy period of festive fixtures.</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The Premier League is set to continue throughout the Christmas period despite the ongoing COVID concerns, so the FPL General is here to get you ready for what will hopefully be a busy period of festive fixtures. There's the usual watchlist update, captaincy advice plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>If one still holds the first wildcard, when is the best to play it, GW19 or GW20?</li><li> Is it time to dump double Chelsea defence?</li><li> Is big at the back still a viable strategy? If so, who are the preferred players?</li><li> Is it too much of a knee jerk transfer to get Son in?</li><li> Is Bernardo Silva a hold?</li><li> With Martinelli emerging as another midfield asset, can we go without a Man City midfielder given the rotation risks and stick to nailed assets like Son, Mount, Raphinha etc?</li><li> Is it time to sell ESR or will his game time improve?</li><li> Do we target Ronaldo this gameweek?</li><li> Assuming Salah is your captain, best options for vice-captain if a game is postponed?</li><li> Should we be starting to plan transfers towards potential upcoming DGWs, or stick with week-by-week reactionary transfers given COVID disruption?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The Premier League is set to continue throughout the Christmas period despite the ongoing COVID concerns, so the FPL General is here to get you ready for what will hopefully be a busy period of festive fixtures. There's the usual watchlist update, captaincy advice plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>If one still holds the first wildcard, when is the best to play it, GW19 or GW20?</li><li> Is it time to dump double Chelsea defence?</li><li> Is big at the back still a viable strategy? If so, who are the preferred players?</li><li> Is it too much of a knee jerk transfer to get Son in?</li><li> Is Bernardo Silva a hold?</li><li> With Martinelli emerging as another midfield asset, can we go without a Man City midfielder given the rotation risks and stick to nailed assets like Son, Mount, Raphinha etc?</li><li> Is it time to sell ESR or will his game time improve?</li><li> Do we target Ronaldo this gameweek?</li><li> Assuming Salah is your captain, best options for vice-captain if a game is postponed?</li><li> Should we be starting to plan transfers towards potential upcoming DGWs, or stick with week-by-week reactionary transfers given COVID disruption?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Navigating the covid uncertainty</title>
			<itunes:title>Navigating the covid uncertainty</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Fri, 17 Dec 2021 14:01:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>32:50</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/eef2ed04-3815-11ec-abc7-17948cd92b5f/media.mp3" length="47339480" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">eef2ed04-3815-11ec-abc7-17948cd92b5f</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=86</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750ec998551779fb8759f</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>With an increasing number of Premier League games being postponed due to covid cases, the FPL General tries his best to navigate his way through the uncertainty and assess the most sensible approach for your FPL team right now</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[With an increasing number of Premier League games being postponed due to covid cases, the FPL General tries his best to navigate his way through the uncertainty and assess the most sensible approach for your FPL team right now</p><ul><li>With the current situation, would you use any free transfers to try and get as many players out as possible or roll them for whenever things become a little clearer?</li><li> Would you or are you considering Free Hit?</li><li> How many hits are worth taking to field a playing 11?</li><li> What is the best strategy for getting through a Covid filled winter?</li><li> Do we try to keep some blanking players due to future DGWs?</li><li> Is Antonio to Watkins now the most no-brainer transfer in FPL history?</li><li> Is it still worth getting Mason Mount into my FPL team, given he's one of the few options still playing.</li><li>Is KDB worth a punt?</li><li> Best replacements for Livramento?</li><li> What's the point? It feels like what you do you're damned if you do or damned if you don't.</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
