			<description><![CDATA[We've got another midweek round of Premier League fixtures starting on Tuesday, so the FPL General is here to get you up to speed with his usual batch of transfer advice, captaincy choices, an updated watchlist, and these burning questions dealt with:</p><ul><li>Stick with King or switch to Dennis?</li><li>Best Raphinha replacement - Foden, Bernardo or Bowen?</li><li>Bowen or Gallagher?</li><li>Is it time to drop the double Chelsea defence?</li><li>Who to get rid of first Wilson or Antonio? Is Watkins the top replacement?</li><li>Which players should we definitely NOT sell to raise money to get Ronaldo?</li><li>Finally lost patience with Vardy. Is he a hold for Spurs? If not, who’s the best option?</li><li>Is Dalot a possible Livramento replacement?</li><li>Any advice for people who feel like they are just treading water?</li><li>Thoughts on triple captaining Salah at home against Newcastle?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
