			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is here to assess the landscape after gameweek 15 and get you ready to go again before the weekend. There's transfer advice, captaincy picks, a watchlist update and your questions answered]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General is here to assess the landscape after gameweek 15 and get you ready to go again before the weekend. There's transfer advice, captaincy picks, a watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Rank Sancho, Bruno, Rashford &amp; Ronaldo ahead of United's great fixture run?</li><li>Is Dalot worth serious consideration given his price?</li><li>If you've kept Kane this long, do you hold for one more week against a depleted Brighton defence or move to Ronaldo ahead of United's good run starting with Norwich?</li><li>Is big at the back turning into big in midfield? </li><li>Silva, Foden or Gundogan?</li><li>Should we stick with Raphinha or switch to an option like Foden or Bernardo as Leeds fixtures are very tough for the next few gameweeks?</li><li>Is it time to say goodbye to Ivan Toney?</li><li>Who's fixtures should we be targeting over the Christmas period?</li><li>Should we consider Watkins with Villa's great fixtures?</li><li>Thoughts on Armando Broja at Southampton?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The FPL General is here to assess the landscape after gameweek 15 and get you ready to go again before the weekend. There's transfer advice, captaincy picks, a watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Rank Sancho, Bruno, Rashford &amp; Ronaldo ahead of United's great fixture run?</li><li>Is Dalot worth serious consideration given his price?</li><li>If you've kept Kane this long, do you hold for one more week against a depleted Brighton defence or move to Ronaldo ahead of United's good run starting with Norwich?</li><li>Is big at the back turning into big in midfield? </li><li>Silva, Foden or Gundogan?</li><li>Should we stick with Raphinha or switch to an option like Foden or Bernardo as Leeds fixtures are very tough for the next few gameweeks?</li><li>Is it time to say goodbye to Ivan Toney?</li><li>Who's fixtures should we be targeting over the Christmas period?</li><li>Should we consider Watkins with Villa's great fixtures?</li><li>Thoughts on Armando Broja at Southampton?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
