			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround to gameweek 15 after a hectic round of midweek fixtures and the FPL General is here to get you set up and ready to go again.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround to gameweek 15 after a hectic round of midweek fixtures and the FPL General is here to get you set up and ready to go again. There's captaincy picks, transfer advice, a watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>With most premium defenders getting 2 points or less, is big at the back no more?</li><li>What are your thoughts on Alonso?</li><li>What to do with Kane? Switch to Ronaldo for United’s great run or downgrade to be able to spread the cash around more?</li><li>Given Man City's fixtures, which players should we consider transferring in?</li><li>Dennis or King? </li><li>What to do with Antonio? Hold or sell?</li><li>Should we be considering the Liverpool double up and finding room for Robertson in a back 4 or 5?</li><li>What to do with Bryan Mbuemo?</li><li>Should I go for B.Silva or Mount to replace Zaha?</li><li>Are you enjoying the fact Salah is almost a perma-captain for most given you've often said removing captaincy is the first change you'd make to FPL?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround to gameweek 15 after a hectic round of midweek fixtures and the FPL General is here to get you set up and ready to go again. There's captaincy picks, transfer advice, a watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>With most premium defenders getting 2 points or less, is big at the back no more?</li><li>What are your thoughts on Alonso?</li><li>What to do with Kane? Switch to Ronaldo for United’s great run or downgrade to be able to spread the cash around more?</li><li>Given Man City's fixtures, which players should we consider transferring in?</li><li>Dennis or King? </li><li>What to do with Antonio? Hold or sell?</li><li>Should we be considering the Liverpool double up and finding room for Robertson in a back 4 or 5?</li><li>What to do with Bryan Mbuemo?</li><li>Should I go for B.Silva or Mount to replace Zaha?</li><li>Are you enjoying the fact Salah is almost a perma-captain for most given you've often said removing captaincy is the first change you'd make to FPL?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
