			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround this week with the gameweek 14 deadline coming on Tuesday before a full programme of mid-week fixtures, so with that in mind the FPL General is armed with transfer advice, captaincy picks, and a watchlist update]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround this week with the gameweek 14 deadline coming on Tuesday before a full programme of midweek fixtures, so with that in mind the FPL General is armed with transfer advice, captaincy picks, and a watchlist update and answers to these questions:</p><ul><li>Do you think people should have a full playing bench given the congested fixtures or can we get away with just 1 or 2 playing subs?</li><li>How do you feel about just burning a transfer?</li><li>Is Jota a must-own?</li><li> Best replacement for Chilwell? - Reguilon or Alonso or someone else?</li><li> Alonso versus Gallagher. Where do you see better value?</li><li> What do we do with Son and/or Kane?</li><li> Best Mbeumo replacement?</li><li> Is Vardy a hold or sell for Kane/Lukaku?</li><li> What do you think about Maddison after his goal and two assists?</li><li> Is it time to offload Havertz now that Lukaku is back?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[It's a quick turnaround this week with the gameweek 14 deadline coming on Tuesday before a full programme of midweek fixtures, so with that in mind the FPL General is armed with transfer advice, captaincy picks, and a watchlist update and answers to these questions:</p><ul><li>Do you think people should have a full playing bench given the congested fixtures or can we get away with just 1 or 2 playing subs?</li><li>How do you feel about just burning a transfer?</li><li>Is Jota a must-own?</li><li> Best replacement for Chilwell? - Reguilon or Alonso or someone else?</li><li> Alonso versus Gallagher. Where do you see better value?</li><li> What do we do with Son and/or Kane?</li><li> Best Mbeumo replacement?</li><li> Is Vardy a hold or sell for Kane/Lukaku?</li><li> What do you think about Maddison after his goal and two assists?</li><li> Is it time to offload Havertz now that Lukaku is back?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
