		<item>
			<title>Gameweek 12 preview: Son or Kane? James or Chillwell?</title>
			<itunes:title>Gameweek 12 preview: Son or Kane? James or Chillwell?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Wed, 17 Nov 2021 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>31:37</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/ed39b1fa-3815-11ec-abc7-0304eea8e8c9/media.mp3" length="45587799" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">ed39b1fa-3815-11ec-abc7-0304eea8e8c9</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=78</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750e19bd0275f2c4a4074</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[With the international break over the FPL General is here to get us back in the groove for gameweek 12 as the Premier League returns. There's a watchlist update, captaincy picks, transfer advice plus your questions answered]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[With the international break over the FPL General is here to get us back in the groove for gameweek 12 as the Premier League returns. There's a watchlist update, captaincy picks, transfer advice plus all these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is Son or Kane a must-own this week or a wait and see until next GW?</li><li>Stick or twist with Mbuemo and Toney?</li><li>Is Vardy worth keeping, or is it time to downgrade to the likes of Wilson and Jimenez and upgrade in defence or midfield?</li><li>If Robertson is injured, is it worth prioritising Tsimikas over Jota as third Liverpool spot?</li><li>Best Robert Sanchez replacement?</li><li>Reece James or Ben Chillwell?</li><li>Who are the differential players you would go for before playing a wildcard in GW15 or 16?</li><li>What are your thoughts on Steven Gerrard’s Villa move with regards to FPL?</li><li>Is there a case for West Ham's Ben Johnson as a £4.0m defender?</li><li>Thoughts on spending big on 4 or 5 premium wing backs on a wildcard this week?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[With the international break over the FPL General is here to get us back in the groove for gameweek 12 as the Premier League returns. There's a watchlist update, captaincy picks, transfer advice plus all these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is Son or Kane a must-own this week or a wait and see until next GW?</li><li>Stick or twist with Mbuemo and Toney?</li><li>Is Vardy worth keeping, or is it time to downgrade to the likes of Wilson and Jimenez and upgrade in defence or midfield?</li><li>If Robertson is injured, is it worth prioritising Tsimikas over Jota as third Liverpool spot?</li><li>Best Robert Sanchez replacement?</li><li>Reece James or Ben Chillwell?</li><li>Who are the differential players you would go for before playing a wildcard in GW15 or 16?</li><li>What are your thoughts on Steven Gerrard’s Villa move with regards to FPL?</li><li>Is there a case for West Ham's Ben Johnson as a £4.0m defender?</li><li>Thoughts on spending big on 4 or 5 premium wing backs on a wildcard this week?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Is it time to invest in Spurs assets now that Conte is in charge?</title>
			<itunes:title>Is it time to invest in Spurs assets now that Conte is in charge?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 02 Nov 2021 15:50:50 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>29:31</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/ec77a092-3815-11ec-abc7-732368ebdf77/media.mp3" length="42563199" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">ec77a092-3815-11ec-abc7-732368ebdf77</guid>
