			<acast:episodeId>683750df6e5b65d787578be1</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>With good fixtures and a potential new manager bounce with the arrival of serial winner Antonio Conte, is it time to get in early on Spurs assets? The FPL General rounds up a busy gameweek 10, updates his watchlist and answers your questions:</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[With good fixtures and a potential new manager bounce with the arrival of serial winner Antonio Conte, is it time to get in early on Spurs assets? The FPL General rounds up a busy gameweek 10, updates his watchlist and answers these questions:</p><ul><li>With Conte to Spurs seeming like a done deal, do we wait a game or two or jump on Spurs assets immediately?</li><li>Is it time to sell Raphinha?</li><li>Mbuemo to Smith-Rowe or hold for Norwich?</li><li>Is it overthinking to sell Antonio just because he has a few difficult fixtures coming up?</li><li>Could Antonio to Jimenez be a shrewd move?</li><li> What to do with Vardy?</li><li> Thoughts on bringing in Reece James for Joao Cancelo?</li><li> Thoughts on Ronaldo after his haul at the weekend? Keep or sell?</li><li> Should we go all in on Maxwell Cornet?</li><li> Views on Tyrick Mitchell?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[With good fixtures and a potential new manager bounce with the arrival of serial winner Antonio Conte, is it time to get in early on Spurs assets? The FPL General rounds up a busy gameweek 10, updates his watchlist and answers these questions:</p><ul><li>With Conte to Spurs seeming like a done deal, do we wait a game or two or jump on Spurs assets immediately?</li><li>Is it time to sell Raphinha?</li><li>Mbuemo to Smith-Rowe or hold for Norwich?</li><li>Is it overthinking to sell Antonio just because he has a few difficult fixtures coming up?</li><li>Could Antonio to Jimenez be a shrewd move?</li><li> What to do with Vardy?</li><li> Thoughts on bringing in Reece James for Joao Cancelo?</li><li> Thoughts on Ronaldo after his haul at the weekend? Keep or sell?</li><li> Should we go all in on Maxwell Cornet?</li><li> Views on Tyrick Mitchell?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
