		<item>
			<title>FPL Friday: WILDCARD ACTIVATED</title>
			<itunes:title>FPL Friday: WILDCARD ACTIVATED</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Fri, 15 Oct 2021 14:44:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>18:25</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/3b345fc0-2481-11ec-8983-9bbed3025d97/media.mp3" length="26577211" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">3b345fc0-2481-11ec-8983-9bbed3025d97</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=72</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750de998551779fb87113</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with an update ahead of Saturday morning's GW8 deadline. He's tuned in to all the press conferences so has the latest team news to help you make those all important captaincy and transfer decisions.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General has activated his wildcard and he's here with an update on his latest draft ahead of Saturday morning's GW8 deadline.</p><p>He's tuned in to all the press conferences so has the latest team news to help you make those all important captaincy and transfer decisions, plus answers these questions:</p><ul><li>Is Trent a must have despite the fixtures Liverpool have?</li><li>Is a move to a city defender a good use of 1 FT this GW?</li><li>If Rüdiger is confirmed out do I go straight to TAA or hold off until GW10?</li><li>Chilwell over Rudiger on wildcard?</li><li>Should we get five premiums at the back (TAA, 2 city, 2 chelsea) as they can be good value for money for the upcoming gameweeks?</li><li>Very tempted by Mason Mount on WC. Would you go there?</li><li>Do you keep or get rid of Antonio on a wildcard and go with double brentford attack?</li><li>Is KDB a viable option for his price tag this season?</li><li>Is it time to move Ronaldo on for Lukaku? Or go for someone like Vardy who is in form?</li><li>Is Mason Greenwood still worth having?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General has activated his wildcard and he's here with an update on his latest draft ahead of Saturday morning's GW8 deadline.</p><p>He's tuned in to all the press conferences so has the latest team news to help you make those all important captaincy and transfer decisions, plus answers these questions:</p><ul><li>Is Trent a must have despite the fixtures Liverpool have?</li><li>Is a move to a city defender a good use of 1 FT this GW?</li><li>If Rüdiger is confirmed out do I go straight to TAA or hold off until GW10?</li><li>Chilwell over Rudiger on wildcard?</li><li>Should we get five premiums at the back (TAA, 2 city, 2 chelsea) as they can be good value for money for the upcoming gameweeks?</li><li>Very tempted by Mason Mount on WC. Would you go there?</li><li>Do you keep or get rid of Antonio on a wildcard and go with double brentford attack?</li><li>Is KDB a viable option for his price tag this season?</li><li>Is it time to move Ronaldo on for Lukaku? Or go for someone like Vardy who is in form?</li><li>Is Mason Greenwood still worth having?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
