			<title><![CDATA[Do we double up on City& Chelsea defenders and is it time to think about Vardy?]]></title>
			<itunes:title><![CDATA[Do we double up on City& Chelsea defenders and is it time to think about Vardy?]]></itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 12 Oct 2021 13:29:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>30:10</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/3aabc782-2481-11ec-8983-ff8bd64aa4c2/media.mp3" length="43491428" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">3aabc782-2481-11ec-8983-ff8bd64aa4c2</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=71</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750ec998551779fb875a4</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is back from his international break hiatus and ready to hit the ground running in search of those precious green arrows. He's got captaincy picks, transfer advice and a watchlist update]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General is back from his international break hiatus and ready to hit the ground running in search of those precious green arrows. He's got captaincy picks, transfer advice, a watchlist update, his latest thoughts on a wildcard and answers these questions:</p><ul><li>Is Trent still worth the money or is it better to spread the extra £1.5m on a double double up of City and Chelsea defenders?</li><li>Do we keep or sell Antonio?</li><li>Is Alonso or Chilwell viable and worth the potential upside with strongish bench options (Livramento/White)?</li><li>Is Vardy a better option than Lukaku now?</li><li>With Pep roulette are Ederson &amp; Dias a good City defence double up?</li><li>Is KDB being overlooked as a viable premium asset? </li><li>Foden or Grealish?</li><li>Best front three on a wildcard?</li><li>Now that Hwang seems to have secured a starting spot alongside Jimenez, is he a good placeholder for a couple of weeks before turning to Toney in Gameweek 10?</li><li>What are the best GW8 one-week punts for those of us wildcarding in GW9?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
