			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with a last minute blast of advice and wisdom before Saturday's gameweek 7 deadline. Transfers, captaincy and his team reveal plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is Trent a hold or do we sell now and move onto Man City/Chelsea defenders then potentially bring Trent back later on?</li><li>What to do with Jota?</li><li>Best 1-week punt before WC GW8 to replace Bamford?</li><li>Zaha or Gallagher?</li><li>Sarr or Benrahma for 1-week pre WC punt?</li><li>Which 2 Chelsea defenders?</li><li>Reece James - stick or twist?</li><li>Is Lukaku-Salah-Ronaldo a viable trio over the near future in the absence of Alexander-Arnold?</li><li>Thoughts on Ødegaard, or are Saka / ESR better picks?</li><li>Is Raphinha a viable captaincy option against a leaky Watford?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
