		<item>
			<title>The Chelsea conundrum - which players do we go for?</title>
			<itunes:title>The Chelsea conundrum - which players do we go for?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 21 Sep 2021 13:42:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>29:33</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/77275bc0-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-53ef4f601937/media.mp3" length="42595579" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">77275bc0-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-53ef4f601937</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=68</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750eb6e5b65d787579446</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General reflects on a tricky gameweek 5, before looking ahead to this weekend's fixtures with captaincy & transfer advice and a watchlist update]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General reflects on a tricky gameweek 5, before looking ahead to this weekend's fixtures with captaincy &amp; transfer advice, a watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Alonso or Rudiger?</li><li>Thoughts on a Chelsea triple up in defence after the Man City fixture this Gameweek?</li><li>Would you swap Antonio in for Bamford?</li><li>Is Greenwood going to lose his place soon with Sancho, Rashford and Lingard waiting?</li><li>If you have Torres, do you keep or sell?</li><li>Is it time to start considering Vardy as a viable premium-lite option?</li><li>Should I wildcard if I've had a bad start to the season?</li><li>Is it worth saving 0.5m and going for Walker over Cancelo/Dias?</li><li>Ronaldo or Lukaku on a wildcard this week?</li><li>What are the teams to target other than Chelsea in the upcoming fixtures?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
