			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is here with some last minute advice before this week's Friday deadline ahead of Newcastle v Leeds. He's got team news from the press conferences, captaincy picks, transfer tips and his team reveal for GW5.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here with some last minute advice before this week's Friday deadline ahead of Newcastle v Leeds. He's got team news from the press conferences, captaincy picks, transfer tips, his team reveal for GW5 and these 10 quickfire questions answered:</p><ul><li>Rank these 6.5 million and below midfielders - Gallagher, Gray, Sarr and Raphina</li><li>Is it worth doubling up on the Wolves defence?</li><li>Which striker below 6 million is worth a punt for the next 4-5 weeks?</li><li>What are your thoughts on captaining a defender for a differential?</li><li>Bamford or Jimenez?</li><li>What to do with Mahrez?</li><li>Luke Shaw - stick or twist?</li><li>Semedo or Tierney to replace Coufal?</li><li>Is Gabriel Jesus a realistic option to replace Calvert-Lewin?</li><li>Is Adama Traore still an option for you?</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Remember the deadline is at 18:30 tonight!</strong></p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here with some last minute advice before this week's Friday deadline ahead of Newcastle v Leeds. He's got team news from the press conferences, captaincy picks, transfer tips, his team reveal for GW5 and these 10 quickfire questions answered:</p><ul><li>Rank these 6.5 million and below midfielders - Gallagher, Gray, Sarr and Raphina</li><li>Is it worth doubling up on the Wolves defence?</li><li>Which striker below 6 million is worth a punt for the next 4-5 weeks?</li><li>What are your thoughts on captaining a defender for a differential?</li><li>Bamford or Jimenez?</li><li>What to do with Mahrez?</li><li>Luke Shaw - stick or twist?</li><li>Semedo or Tierney to replace Coufal?</li><li>Is Gabriel Jesus a realistic option to replace Calvert-Lewin?</li><li>Is Adama Traore still an option for you?</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Remember the deadline is at 18:30 tonight!</strong></p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
