		<item>
			<title>Do we stick or twist now Antonio is suspended?</title>
			<itunes:title>Do we stick or twist now Antonio is suspended?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 14 Sep 2021 15:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>35:12</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/770bae48-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-8beb073e7896/media.mp3" length="50743680" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">770bae48-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-8beb073e7896</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=66</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750eb6e5b65d78757944c</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General rounds up all the action from gameweek 4 and gives you his take on best captaincy picks and transfers for GW5.</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General rounds up all the action from gameweek 4 and gives you his take on best captaincy picks and transfers for GW5. Plus there's his watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>With Antonio suspended and DCL not projected to return until GW7, is it time to get either of the Wolves forwards, Bamford, or even Ings?</li><li>Antonio - keep for form and future fixtures, even if we have threadbare benches and may need to play someone like Brownhill and end up with no viable subs this week, or change to Bamford?</li><li>Who is the best replacement for DCL?</li><li>Do you think Salah, Ronaldo and Lukaku in the team is a viable option?</li><li>If wildcarding this week, would you fade, Ronaldo for Lukaku?</li><li>Who is the best Wolves option in defence?</li><li>Is it time to offload Benrahma, particularly for the likes of Gray?</li><li>Is Conor Gallagher now a legitimate enabler or a trap?</li><li>Any love for Pukki as a replacement for the underperforming Toney?</li><li>Do you think Ramsdale could be worth inclusion if you're playing a wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The FPL General rounds up all the action from gameweek 4 and gives you his take on best captaincy picks and transfers for GW5. Plus there's his watchlist update and these questions answered:</p><ul><li>With Antonio suspended and DCL not projected to return until GW7, is it time to get either of the Wolves forwards, Bamford, or even Ings?</li><li>Antonio - keep for form and future fixtures, even if we have threadbare benches and may need to play someone like Brownhill and end up with no viable subs this week, or change to Bamford?</li><li>Who is the best replacement for DCL?</li><li>Do you think Salah, Ronaldo and Lukaku in the team is a viable option?</li><li>If wildcarding this week, would you fade, Ronaldo for Lukaku?</li><li>Who is the best Wolves option in defence?</li><li>Is it time to offload Benrahma, particularly for the likes of Gray?</li><li>Is Conor Gallagher now a legitimate enabler or a trap?</li><li>Any love for Pukki as a replacement for the underperforming Toney?</li><li>Do you think Ramsdale could be worth inclusion if you're playing a wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
