		<item>
			<title>Is Ronaldo worth taking a points hit for?</title>
			<itunes:title>Is Ronaldo worth taking a points hit for?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 07 Sep 2021 14:14:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>32:14</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/76ee8084-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-6f5a1f8c5ed1/media.mp3" length="46467494" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">76ee8084-0bd8-11ec-a5e0-6f5a1f8c5ed1</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=64</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750ea6e5b65d787579401</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General is back with a look ahead to the resumption of the Premier League, he's got his usual watchlist update, advice on captaincy and transfers, plus his take on the all important question of whether to sacrifice points to get Ronaldo into your team.]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The FPL General is back with a look ahead to the resumption of the Premier League, he's got his usual watchlist update, advice on captaincy and transfers, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>If there’s a number of players with issues coming back from international break (say 4-5 were flagged), would you wildcard or ride it out for a week?</li><li>Is a wildcard a worthy consideration at this point if you have a FT and thinking only 2/3 changes to your squad, better taking the hit on points?</li><li> Is Ronaldo value for £12.5m vs the mid-priced forwards?</li><li> Does Ronaldo help or hinder Man United's other assets such as Greenwood and Bruno?</li><li> What's your view on Ronaldo for a hit?</li><li> Could you rank these forwards? Antonio, DCL, Jimenez, Bamford.</li><li> How do you rank Jota, Greenwood and Torres as options from this Gameweek onwards?</li><li> Is Ismaila Sarr being overlooked as a downgrade to fund Ronaldo?</li><li> Are we overlooking Spurs assets?</li><li> Best GK options for those on wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
