			<pubDate>Tue, 17 Aug 2021 14:21:47 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>30:28</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/12c76a9e-f3f0-11eb-9abf-2773bd7e4076/media.mp3" length="43925038" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">12c76a9e-f3f0-11eb-9abf-2773bd7e4076</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-fpl-podcast/?episode=60</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750f27b483718e05ed46f</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General reacts to a massive opening weekend in FPL with high scores galore. There's advice on captaincy, transfers, his first watchlist update of the season and his take on what to do with Man City assets for GW2]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General reacts to a massive opening weekend in FPL with high scores galore. There's advice on captaincy, transfers, a watchlist update, and we welcome the season's first inductees into the 59th Minute Club</p><p>All that plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is getting Benrahma for Raphinha too knee jerk or getting in early on a form player for one that did not impress?</li><li> Are Man City assets essential for GW2?</li><li>What's the Man City plan? And the Son plan after? Is it worth ignoring city, saving the free transfer and getting onto son gw3?</li><li> With Gundogan possibly injured, who is his best replacement?</li><li> Do we keep Mahrez?</li><li> Is the sensible move to get rid of a player that didn't look right in gw1 (Harvey Barnes) or bank a transfer?</li><li> Is it worth offloading Son to get Lukaku?</li><li> Keep Greenwood or replace with Grealish?</li><li> Is it worth switching Jota to Grealish/Greenwood?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General reacts to a massive opening weekend in FPL with high scores galore. There's advice on captaincy, transfers, a watchlist update, and we welcome the season's first inductees into the 59th Minute Club</p><p>All that plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Is getting Benrahma for Raphinha too knee jerk or getting in early on a form player for one that did not impress?</li><li> Are Man City assets essential for GW2?</li><li>What's the Man City plan? And the Son plan after? Is it worth ignoring city, saving the free transfer and getting onto son gw3?</li><li> With Gundogan possibly injured, who is his best replacement?</li><li> Do we keep Mahrez?</li><li> Is the sensible move to get rid of a player that didn't look right in gw1 (Harvey Barnes) or bank a transfer?</li><li> Is it worth offloading Son to get Lukaku?</li><li> Keep Greenwood or replace with Grealish?</li><li> Is it worth switching Jota to Grealish/Greenwood?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
