		<item>
			<title>How to cope with no Man Utd, Chelsea or Leicester players in gameweek 36</title>
			<itunes:title>How to cope with no Man Utd, Chelsea or Leicester players in gameweek 36</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Thu, 13 May 2021 11:40:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>27:34</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/bcf94018-acbb-11eb-895c-3b695f5278bd/media.mp3" length="26532253" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">bcf94018-acbb-11eb-895c-3b695f5278bd</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-the-59th-minute-fpl-podcast/?episode=54</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750e52780b226c7c00b9f</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General is back with his usual words of wisdom as we approach the final four gameweeks of a gruelling FPL season.</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is back with his usual words of wisdom as we approach the final three gameweeks of a gruelling FPL season.</p><p>Transfers and captaincy advice plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Are Man Utd assets worth holding for the rest of the season?</li><li>Who are the alternatives to Bruno Fernandes for the run-in?</li><li>Bamford or Antonio as an Iheanacho replacement?</li><li>Is it worth taking a hit to replace the Mendy/Forster tandem?</li><li>Is doubling up on the Southampton keepers an option?</li><li>Is Stuart Dallas a must-have for the remaining fixtures?</li><li>Is Benrahma over Lingard over-thinking it?</li><li>Who are the essential players for GW36 if you don't have a free-hit?</li><li>If you're on a wildcard who would be the first names on your team sheet?</li><li>Which new chip would you like to see introduced next season?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is back with his usual words of wisdom as we approach the final three gameweeks of a gruelling FPL season.</p><p>Transfers and captaincy advice plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Are Man Utd assets worth holding for the rest of the season?</li><li>Who are the alternatives to Bruno Fernandes for the run-in?</li><li>Bamford or Antonio as an Iheanacho replacement?</li><li>Is it worth taking a hit to replace the Mendy/Forster tandem?</li><li>Is doubling up on the Southampton keepers an option?</li><li>Is Stuart Dallas a must-have for the remaining fixtures?</li><li>Is Benrahma over Lingard over-thinking it?</li><li>Who are the essential players for GW36 if you don't have a free-hit?</li><li>If you're on a wildcard who would be the first names on your team sheet?</li><li>Which new chip would you like to see introduced next season?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
