			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General is here to assess the damage after a disastrous gameweek 34, with the Man Utd v Liverpool postponement causing havoc for managers everywhere</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here to assess the damage after a disastrous gameweek 34, with the Man Utd v Liverpool postponement causing havoc for managers everywhere</p><p>He'll share his thoughts on how to save your season if you're struggling plus answer all these questions:</p><ul><li>With Leno and Remy rotation risks, would you consider moving to a goalkeeper that plays twice in GW36?</li><li>What to do with Diogo Jota?</li><li>What's the best way to make use of a wildcard this week?</li><li>Who makes way out of Iheanacho, Kane or Wood if I want to bring in Antonio?</li><li>Is it time to replace Kane for a striker with a double gameweek if we've got Son?</li><li>Is Gareth Bale a trap? I feel like I've fallen for it too many times this season already...</li><li>Who is the best defender to consider until the end of the season?</li><li>Who are the triple captain options this weekend?</li><li>Is Zaha a good option or should we avoid Crystal Palace?</li><li>Should we sell Lingard?</li><li>Who are the best 5 million defenders for the rest of the season?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
