			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-the-59th-minute-fpl-podcast/?episode=50</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750f26e5b65d7875795fe</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The General looks to and beyond this weekend's EFL Cup Final, its impact on our GW33 preparations and more...]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The General returns, with a green arrow in sight, to help us navigate Gameweek 33, The EFL Cup Final and beyond. Will he resist the urge to pick up Lingard AGAIN this week and answers to the following:</p><ul><li>Is it time to return to Emi Martinez with our tails between our legs?</li><li>Who is the best replacement for the injured Lacazette?</li><li>Should you hold onto Son now that Mourinho is gone?</li><li>Should you play your free hit this weekend if you still have it?</li><li>Which disposable template players and which differentials could replace them to make up ground in mini-leagues?</li><li>Who should our 3rd striker be, presuming Iheanacho and Kane are everyone's other two!</li><li>Who are the top 5 defenders to own right now?</li><li>What's the strategy for potential upcoming double and blank gameweeks?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The General returns, with a green arrow in sight, to help us navigate Gameweek 33, The EFL Cup Final and beyond. Will he resist the urge to pick up Lingard AGAIN this week and answers to the following:</p><ul><li>Is it time to return to Emi Martinez with our tails between our legs?</li><li>Who is the best replacement for the injured Lacazette?</li><li>Should you hold onto Son now that Mourinho is gone?</li><li>Should you play your free hit this weekend if you still have it?</li><li>Which disposable template players and which differentials could replace them to make up ground in mini-leagues?</li><li>Who should our 3rd striker be, presuming Iheanacho and Kane are everyone's other two!</li><li>Who are the top 5 defenders to own right now?</li><li>What's the strategy for potential upcoming double and blank gameweeks?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
