		<item>
			<title><![CDATA[The Long Gameweek 32 & Eye-Catching Kai Havertz]]></title>
			<itunes:title><![CDATA[The Long Gameweek 32 & Eye-Catching Kai Havertz]]></itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Tue, 13 Apr 2021 15:45:00 GMT</pubDate>
