			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The General moves quickly on from the biggest let-down of a double gameweek in recent memory and ahead to the big questions facing us ahead of Gameweek 27 and beyond...</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is back and eager to move on quickly from a historic double gameweek - which failed to live up to expectations... Fortunately Gameweek 27 is upon us and some big questions need to be answered, that is, if you can all stop looking ahead to 'blank gameweek 29' of course!</p><p>Qs:</p><p>Is it time to replace Bruno Fernandes ahead of a tough run of games for Manchester United?</p><p>Is a Spurs triple-up a good option for the remainder of the season?</p><p>Would it be wise to focus all our attention on the upcoming blank Gameweek 29?</p><p>A Brighton defender or Michail Antonio?</p><p>Best Harvey Barnes replacements for similar money or less?</p><p>Are City's fringe players like Mahrez, Foden &amp; Jesus becoming a good option?</p><p>Who are the best defenders for £4.5m or less?</p><p>And is Alex McCarthy actually worth keeping?</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is back and eager to move on quickly from a historic double gameweek - which failed to live up to expectations... Fortunately Gameweek 27 is upon us and some big questions need to be answered, that is, if you can all stop looking ahead to 'blank gameweek 29' of course!</p><p>Qs:</p><p>Is it time to replace Bruno Fernandes ahead of a tough run of games for Manchester United?</p><p>Is a Spurs triple-up a good option for the remainder of the season?</p><p>Would it be wise to focus all our attention on the upcoming blank Gameweek 29?</p><p>A Brighton defender or Michail Antonio?</p><p>Best Harvey Barnes replacements for similar money or less?</p><p>Are City's fringe players like Mahrez, Foden &amp; Jesus becoming a good option?</p><p>Who are the best defenders for £4.5m or less?</p><p>And is Alex McCarthy actually worth keeping?</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
