		<item>
			<title>How many Man City players do we start against Liverpool?</title>
			<itunes:title>How many Man City players do we start against Liverpool?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Thu, 04 Feb 2021 17:29:39 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>30:57</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/690be604-6701-11eb-87a7-7fd753c5f451/media.mp3" length="29778822" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">690be604-6701-11eb-87a7-7fd753c5f451</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-the-59th-minute-fpl-podcast/?episode=40</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750dd998551779fb870cf</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The gameweeks keep on coming so the FPL General is here with everything you need to know before gw23. There's captaincy and transfer advice, a watchlist update plus your questions answered, including the issue of how many Man City players to start ahead of their game v Liverpool?]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[The gameweeks keep on coming so the FPL General is here with everything you need to know before gw23. There's captaincy and transfer advice, a watchlist update plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>How many Man City players do we start against Liverpool?</li><li>Do we need to buy Son this week if all our midfielders are already performing?</li><li>Is it time to get rid of Salah after his recent inconsistency?</li><li>Time to get rid of Alex McCarthy?</li><li>Should I go for Everton with DCL/Digne or Southampton with Ings?</li><li>Is benching Salah this weekend the worst idea in the world?</li><li>What do you think of Lingard after his scoring debut for West Ham?</li><li>Should we buy Martinez as a 'set and forget' keeper for rest of the season?</li><li>Should we ever bench Soucek again?</li><li>When's the best time to use the second wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[The gameweeks keep on coming so the FPL General is here with everything you need to know before gw23. There's captaincy and transfer advice, a watchlist update plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>How many Man City players do we start against Liverpool?</li><li>Do we need to buy Son this week if all our midfielders are already performing?</li><li>Is it time to get rid of Salah after his recent inconsistency?</li><li>Time to get rid of Alex McCarthy?</li><li>Should I go for Everton with DCL/Digne or Southampton with Ings?</li><li>Is benching Salah this weekend the worst idea in the world?</li><li>What do you think of Lingard after his scoring debut for West Ham?</li><li>Should we buy Martinez as a 'set and forget' keeper for rest of the season?</li><li>Should we ever bench Soucek again?</li><li>When's the best time to use the second wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
