			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[It's another tight turnaround for gameweek 22 so the FPL General is ready to go with transfer advice, captaincy picks, a watchlist update and answers to your questions including the issues of dealing with Pep Guardiola's obsession with rotating his team]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[It's another tight turnaround for gameweek 22 so the FPL General is ready to go with transfer advice, captaincy picks, a watchlist update and answers to all these burning questions:</p><ul><li>For those of us who brought in DCL do we stick or cut our losses?</li><li>Is the wisest method for next few weeks to limit hits and stick with your picks?</li><li>Is it worth looking for a Son replacement while Kane is out?</li><li>What to do with Chilwell?</li><li>What to do with Stones and Cancelo now that Pep is playing roulette with his defence?</li><li>What advice do you have for managers who are struggling to hit their stride at the moment?</li><li>If you have two free transfers and a good team, how do you avoid weakening the squad?</li><li>With Pereira on such fine form should we be considering him as an option?</li><li>Is having too much points potential on the bench a help or a hindrance?</li><li>Do we start planning for the upcoming double gameweeks now?</li><li>When are you planning to use your second wildcard?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
