			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General reflects on a very hectic double gameweek and gives tackles the big questions ahead of gameweek 20 most of what to do now that KDB is injured and Salah is badly out of form</itunes:subtitle>
