			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General reflects on a very hectic double gameweek and gives you all the advice you need ahead of gameweek 20 which gets underway on Tuesday.</p><p>All the usual transfers, captaincy and watchlist updates, as well as these questions answered:</p><ul><li>What advice would you give to managers in the top 10k to maintain their position?</li><li>Is KDB to Son a no-brainer?</li><li>Other replacements for KDB?</li><li>How would you rank Son, Rashford, Maddison as potential Salah replacements?</li><li>Is player price a distraction given the current high-priced flops?</li><li>Which two Man City defenders would you recommend in a double-up?</li><li>Are Trent and Robertson no longer a realistic double-up?</li><li>Give me a differential for each position to hold from now until end of season...</li><li>Are we being too patient with Salah?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
