			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General is here to provide guidance on how best to navigate the increasingly disrupted and unpredictable FPL schedule</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here to provide guidance on how best to navigate the increasingly disrupted and unpredictable FPL schedule</p><p>Plenty of captaincy &amp; transfer advice, the usual watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Should we fill our free-hit squads with differentials?</li><li>Does it make sense to play free-hit if there are only 5 games being played?</li><li>Do you enjoy how chaotic this FPL season has become or long for a return to normality?</li><li>Is it best to save your chips for later in the season when the covid postponements have calmed down?</li><li>If I use two free transfers now and then free-hit a day later will my free transfers remain or be cancelled?</li><li>Lacazette or Martial for free-hit squads?</li><li>Who are the top differentials for GW 18?</li><li>Is it worth taking a points hit to get 9 players for GW18 enabling us to keep our free-hit chip for later in the season?</li><li>With all the postponements is the wildcard becoming more of an option for those of us who used our first wildcard early?</li><li>Are triple-ups too risky this season with all the potential postponements?</li><li>Double gameweek19 - to bench boost or not?</li><li>Is KDB a trap?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
