		<item>
			<title>Changing plans for double gameweek 19 + is it time to replace Son with Rashford?</title>
			<itunes:title>Changing plans for double gameweek 19 + is it time to replace Son with Rashford?</itunes:title>
			<pubDate>Thu, 31 Dec 2020 13:56:21 GMT</pubDate>
			<itunes:duration>35:31</itunes:duration>
			<enclosure url="https://sphinx.acast.com/p/open/s/683750c96e5b65d787575771/e/43e2b1dc-0275-11eb-b495-f34b9ce89ad2/media.mp3" length="51207452" type="audio/mpeg"/>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">43e2b1dc-0275-11eb-b495-f34b9ce89ad2</guid>
			<itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
			<link>https://theathletic.com/podcast/166-the-59th-minute-fpl-podcast/?episode=34</link>
			<acast:episodeId>683750f42780b226c7c00f54</acast:episodeId>
			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here to pick up the pieces after a disrupted gameweek 16 that saw two games postponed and some big players left pointless.</p><p>He's got all the usual advice on captaincy picks, transfer plans, watchlist update, plus all your questions answered, a lot with the upcoming blank and double gameweeks in mind...</p><ul><li>Would you say it's better to wait until the last minute to make transfers and ignore price changes?</li><li>Is it still worth planning to bench boost in GW19 given the postponements we saw this week?</li><li>Who's the best 4.4 million or less defender?</li><li>Is it worth taking hits to bring in players for the double gameweek 19?</li><li>Is using our free hit chip in gw18 now a waste with more double gameweeks to come?</li><li>What are your thoughts on Meslier for the double gameweek?</li><li>Would you go double Leeds attack?</li><li>Is Michail Antonio worth a gamble for double gameweek 19?</li><li>Are you scaling back your forward planning and only looking two or three weeks ahead?</li><li>Is the lesson from the last few days to make sure we have a strong bench?</li><li>Is Rashford a better option than Son?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
