			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General previews both of the upcoming gameweeks as the festive football comes at us thick and fast. He's got plenty of advice for those of you playing your wildcards]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General previews both of the upcoming gameweeks as the festive football comes at us thick and fast. He's got plenty of advice for those of you playing your wildcards, plus all the usual tips on captaincy choices, transfers, watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>In order of priority for double gameweek 16, how do you rank KDB, Salah, Son and Bruno?</li><li>Is new info about double gameweek 26 changing your chip strategy?</li><li>Which players are essential on a gameweek 16 wildcard?</li><li>Is now a good time to go for a Robertson and Alexander-Arnold double-up?</li><li>Do the fixtures of Spurs, Liverpool and West Ham lend themselves to a wildcard before gameweek 15?</li><li>Who are the best one-week-punts for those of us wildcarding in gameweek 16?</li><li>Who are the best five players to pick up on a free-hit in gameweek 18?</li><li>Who are the best Chilwell replacements?</li><li>What is the maximum number of single game players holding on to in double gameweek 16?</li><li>Who would you rather own long-term Robertson or Grealish?</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Gameweek 15 deadline is Saturday 26th December 11am</strong></p><p><strong>Gameweek 16 deadline is Monday 28th December 1.30pm</strong></p><br><p><strong>Give the gift of The Athletic this Christmas</strong></p><p>Subscribe to The Athletic and get a second subscription for free to give to someone as a gift</p><p>Head to <a href="theathletic.com/fplpod">theathletic.com/fplpod</a> to take advantage of this offer now</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General previews both of the upcoming gameweeks as the festive football comes at us thick and fast. He's got plenty of advice for those of you playing your wildcards, plus all the usual tips on captaincy choices, transfers, watchlist update, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>In order of priority for double gameweek 16, how do you rank KDB, Salah, Son and Bruno?</li><li>Is new info about double gameweek 26 changing your chip strategy?</li><li>Which players are essential on a gameweek 16 wildcard?</li><li>Is now a good time to go for a Robertson and Alexander-Arnold double-up?</li><li>Do the fixtures of Spurs, Liverpool and West Ham lend themselves to a wildcard before gameweek 15?</li><li>Who are the best one-week-punts for those of us wildcarding in gameweek 16?</li><li>Who are the best five players to pick up on a free-hit in gameweek 18?</li><li>Who are the best Chilwell replacements?</li><li>What is the maximum number of single game players holding on to in double gameweek 16?</li><li>Who would you rather own long-term Robertson or Grealish?</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Gameweek 15 deadline is Saturday 26th December 11am</strong></p><p><strong>Gameweek 16 deadline is Monday 28th December 1.30pm</strong></p><br><p><strong>Give the gift of The Athletic this Christmas</strong></p><p>Subscribe to The Athletic and get a second subscription for free to give to someone as a gift</p><p>Head to <a href="theathletic.com/fplpod">theathletic.com/fplpod</a> to take advantage of this offer now</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
