			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General is here with a special update now that we know the January fixtures and that gw19 will be a double gameweek</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here with another update as the games keep coming thick and fast, he's got the usual watchlist updates, transfer &amp; captaincy advice for the weekend.</p><p>The January fixtures have been announced and we now know that we'll have a blank gameweek in gw18 and a double gameweek in gw19 so there are a lot of listener questions to get through...</p><ul><li>Which players should we target on a gw16 wildcard?</li><li>How do we tackle gw18 with only five games?</li><li>Best chip strategy for gw19 if you've already used your wildcard?</li><li>When will the second wildcard of the season be released?</li><li>Can we use wildcards in conjunction with chips?</li><li>Triple captain or bench boost in gw19?</li><li>Which defender to buy for the next five gameweeks?</li><li>Who are your top 5 players to aim for in gw19?</li><li>If you had to transfer out Kane or Son who would you go with?</li><li>Best differential pick for gw14?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is here with another update as the games keep coming thick and fast, he's got the usual watchlist updates, transfer &amp; captaincy advice for the weekend.</p><p>The January fixtures have been announced and we now know that we'll have a blank gameweek in gw18 and a double gameweek in gw19 so there are a lot of listener questions to get through...</p><ul><li>Which players should we target on a gw16 wildcard?</li><li>How do we tackle gw18 with only five games?</li><li>Best chip strategy for gw19 if you've already used your wildcard?</li><li>When will the second wildcard of the season be released?</li><li>Can we use wildcards in conjunction with chips?</li><li>Triple captain or bench boost in gw19?</li><li>Which defender to buy for the next five gameweeks?</li><li>Who are your top 5 players to aim for in gw19?</li><li>If you had to transfer out Kane or Son who would you go with?</li><li>Best differential pick for gw14?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
