			<acast:showId>683750c96e5b65d787575771</acast:showId>
			<acast:settings><![CDATA[]]></acast:settings>
			<itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[The FPL General looks ahead to the midweek Premier League fixtures with advice on the best captaincy options - will it be KDB or Bruno Fernandes? Remember that this week's FPL deadline is on Tuesday at 16:30!]]></itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
			<itunes:image href="https://assets.pippa.io/shows/683750c96e5b65d787575771/show-cover.jpg"/>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General looks ahead to the midweek Premier League fixtures with advice on the best captaincy options - will it be KDB or Bruno Fernandes? <strong>Remember that this week's FPL deadline is on Tuesday at 16:30!</strong></p><p>There's also more transfer advice, a watchlist update, review of GW 12, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Has the return of home crowds had an impact on team performance?</li><li>Is Soucek a viable starter now?</li><li>Who is the best option to replace Jota?</li><li>Is John Stones a good price for a gamble or should we stick with Dias or Walker?</li><li>Advice for using the bench boost chip?</li><li>Is it time to sell Ollie Watkins?</li><li>Who are the best Fulham differentials?</li><li>Do we need to have both Kane &amp; Son for the rest of the season?</li><li>Are there any teams that you refuse to sign players from?</li><li>Should I hold Vardy for the upcoming Everton game?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
			<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General looks ahead to the midweek Premier League fixtures with advice on the best captaincy options - will it be KDB or Bruno Fernandes? <strong>Remember that this week's FPL deadline is on Tuesday at 16:30!</strong></p><p>There's also more transfer advice, a watchlist update, review of GW 12, plus these questions answered:</p><ul><li>Has the return of home crowds had an impact on team performance?</li><li>Is Soucek a viable starter now?</li><li>Who is the best option to replace Jota?</li><li>Is John Stones a good price for a gamble or should we stick with Dias or Walker?</li><li>Advice for using the bench boost chip?</li><li>Is it time to sell Ollie Watkins?</li><li>Who are the best Fulham differentials?</li><li>Do we need to have both Kane &amp; Son for the rest of the season?</li><li>Are there any teams that you refuse to sign players from?</li><li>Should I hold Vardy for the upcoming Everton game?</li></ul><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></itunes:summary>
