			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General drops his weekly dose of wisdom as we look ahead to gameweek 12 of the FPL season, including his thoughts on whether Mohammed Salah is the must-have captaincy option this week,</itunes:subtitle>
			<itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
