			<description><![CDATA[<p>The FPL General is back to preview gameweek 10 and send his weekly wisdom your way. We've got a watchlist update, captaincy and transfer advice, plus these questions answered:</p><br><p>- Who are the Man City assets least likely to be rotated?</p><p>- Is James Rodriguez done? Time to swap him for KDB?</p><p>- Who is the best 4.5 defender for the next five fixtures?</p><p>- Is it worth a points hit to get Bruno, Salah and KDB?</p><p>- Ziyech is good, but is he FPL good?</p><p>- Is Diogo Jota worth playing as the 5th midfielder in a 3-5-2?</p><p>- Who's the best cheap replacement for Harry Kane?</p><p>- Would you consider triple captaining KDB against Fulham?</p><p>- Should we pick a 'set and forget' captain? Should it be Bruno?</p><p>- Should we settle for Mahrez if we can't afford KDB without taking a hit?</p><br><p>Sign up to The Athletic for just £1-a-month and get access to the FPL General's exclusive columns, Q&amp;As and ad-free podcasts</p><p>Head to <a href="theathletic.com/fplpod">theathletic.com/fplpod</a></p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
