			<itunes:subtitle>The FPL General is back ahead of the new season of FPL and in this episode he gives you the essential guidelines you need to follow in order to give yourself the best chance of having a good season. Covering topics such as the best time to play your wildcard, the strategy to take when playing your chips, his thought process for captaincy, how much you should be relying upon transfers and some important tips on how to stay sane while playing the game.As well as all this advice the General also answers your twitter questions including the all important topic of how to deal with neither Manchester United or Manchester City playing in Gameweek 1.</itunes:subtitle>
