			<description><![CDATA[<p>With the winter break disrupting the flow of Gameweek 26 the FPL General is here with invaluable advice for anyone looking to play their wildcard, with important info on the perils of price rises and falls, and the potential pitfalls of teams with blank gameweeks ahead, plus as usual he answers all your burning FPL questions</p><p> </p><p>Sign up to The Athletic for ad-free podcasts plus weekly FPL columns and live Q&amp;As with the FPL General himself, just follow this link: theathletic.com/fplpod</p><hr><p style='color:grey; font-size:0.75em;'> Hosted on Acast. See <a style='color:grey;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://acast.com/privacy'>acast.com/privacy</a> for more information.</p>]]></description>
